      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظلّف عَلَيْهِ</span></b> , (IAar, T, O, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَظْلِيفٌ</span>,
(O,) <i>He exceeded it;</i> (IAar, T, O, K;) i. e. [a
certain number of years in age, as, for instance,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السِّتِينَ</span> [<i>sixty</i>], (T,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الخَمْسِينَ</span> [<i>fifty</i>]: (O:)
and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلَّفَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلَّثَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَرَّفَ</span> &amp;c. (T, TA.)

